    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>This plugin provides addon to add custom css for WordPress block editor. This plugin is a companion for our HTML to WordPress extension.</p>\n<p>This plugin also includes addon for creating simple to complex animations using the Gutenberg editor and elementor editor. Custom animation can be produced by providing position, rotation, and other block animation properties.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<p>This section describes how to install the plugin and get it working.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Upload <code>advanced-addons.zip</code> to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory</li>\n<li>Extract the zip file</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress</li>\n<li>Add animation using gutenberg editor</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"can%20it%20be%20used%20for%20other%20than%20gutenberg%3F\">\nCan it be used for other than gutenberg?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, this plugin for gutenberg and elementor editor</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>First release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
